WEBVTT

00:00:03.704 --> 00:00:07.759
CANDY CANDY

00:00:10.621 --> 00:00:16.300
Sobakasu nante kinishinai wa.

00:00:17.229 --> 00:00:22.899
Hana pecha datte datte datte oki ni iri.

00:00:23.933 --> 00:00:27.107
Otenba itazura daisuki,

00:00:27.274 --> 00:00:30.435
Kakekko sukippu daisuki;

00:00:30.704 --> 00:00:35.768
Watashi wa, watashi wa, watashi wa Candy!

00:00:37.034 --> 00:00:43.345
Hitoripocchi de iru to choppiri samishii.

00:00:43.637 --> 00:00:49.704
Sonna toki kou iu no kagami wo mitsumete:

00:00:49.865 --> 00:00:56.205
Waratte, waratte, waratte Candy!

00:00:56.442 --> 00:00:59.109
Nakibeso nante sayonara!

00:00:59.287 --> 00:01:02.537
Nee, Candy Candy!

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:15.670
A midnight picnic.

00:01:54.208 --> 00:02:00.336
With the ending of an exciting May festival,
clear blue skies reigned over the London,

00:02:00.481 --> 00:02:03.681
...marking the beginning of the summer.

00:02:18.372 --> 00:02:25.140
Students have also changed into their
lighter clothes, following the arrival of summertime.

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:31.992
The students are very excited at the
prospect of an incoming summer vacations.

00:02:35.741 --> 00:02:38.110
Summer vacation? That's so nice...

00:02:39.191 --> 00:02:44.554
Say, Candy... I discussed with Patty about this,
how about we all go to Scotland for a summer vacation?

00:02:44.589 --> 00:02:45.635
Scotland?

00:02:46.025 --> 00:02:48.340
Yes. To a summer school in Scotland.

00:02:49.098 --> 00:02:51.313
Summer school? Sounds fun.

00:02:51.746 --> 00:02:53.598
Let's go together!

00:02:55.303 --> 00:02:57.742
Scotland? Doesn't sound too bad.

00:03:00.684 --> 00:03:02.641
Candice White Adley?

00:03:05.399 --> 00:03:09.624
-Candice! What kind of pose is that?
-Yes!

00:03:10.332 --> 00:03:14.059
A lady doesn't behave so immodestly
in front of other people!

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.096
Eating and lying on the ground!

00:03:18.761 --> 00:03:19.722
I'm sorry.

00:03:21.093 --> 00:03:26.147
This school takes pride in raising England's
finest young gentlemen and ladies!

00:03:26.488 --> 00:03:29.529
And yet, what were you doing just now?

00:03:30.723 --> 00:03:31.619
But...

00:03:31.759 --> 00:03:35.688
You understand?
Make sure that this doesn't repeat.

00:03:38.322 --> 00:03:40.835
They'll never make a lady out of her.

00:03:43.951 --> 00:03:48.478
Oh well, I did it again!
I suck at this!

00:03:50.117 --> 00:03:52.001
I think I'll give up on this.

00:03:52.685 --> 00:03:54.241
Going to summer school?

00:03:54.949 --> 00:03:58.895
-It's a school, so sisters will be going with us?
-Yes.

00:03:59.108 --> 00:04:03.115
I want the freedom to do whatever I want
during the summer vacation!

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:05.371
That's it! If I go back to America...

00:04:14.943 --> 00:04:16.083
Pony's home.

00:04:16.851 --> 00:04:19.668
And after that... Anthony's grave.

00:04:25.135 --> 00:04:28.923
-I'm going back to America during the summer vacation!
-Candy!

00:04:32.072 --> 00:04:33.135
What's going on?

00:04:36.577 --> 00:04:37.750
Terry is fighting?

00:04:38.467 --> 00:04:39.617
Candy, Annie!

00:04:40.003 --> 00:04:41.208
Archie is fighting...!

00:04:41.377 --> 00:04:44.705
-Then, Terry is fighting...
-...with Archie!

00:04:48.832 --> 00:04:50.308
Say that again!

00:04:50.898 --> 00:04:54.767
Don't freak out over me badmouthing America!

00:04:55.326 --> 00:04:56.817
America is my homeland!

00:04:56.989 --> 00:04:59.629
I won't forgive those who badmouth my country!

00:05:00.122 --> 00:05:03.723
It's a homeland to you, but it's a
worthless country to me!

00:05:09.381 --> 00:05:11.439
To me, it's a worst country!

00:05:13.825 --> 00:05:15.281
Say that again!

00:05:15.717 --> 00:05:18.073
Stop that, Terry, Archie!

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:21.246
Take this, Terry!

00:05:22.749 --> 00:05:25.100
Stop that, Archie!
Please!

00:05:26.586 --> 00:05:29.899
Can't help this.
They would've done it sooner or later.

00:05:31.788 --> 00:05:33.233
Stop that, the pair of you!

00:05:37.398 --> 00:05:40.972
The troublemakers are here.
Let's part our ways for now.

00:05:43.473 --> 00:05:44.947
Wait up, Terrius.

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:48.690
Why, we were just joking around.

00:05:49.075 --> 00:05:51.233
That's not what I saw.

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:53.290
Who pulled the first punch?

00:05:57.786 --> 00:05:59.963
Well, Archie was the first.

00:06:00.434 --> 00:06:02.817
Is that true, Archibald Cornwell?

00:06:03.556 --> 00:06:05.235
Yes.

00:06:05.355 --> 00:06:09.287
Archibald Cornwell, you will be confined
to a contemplation room in the northern wing.

00:06:09.543 --> 00:06:10.671
Archie!

00:06:10.895 --> 00:06:14.545
You'd lock up Archie without hearing his explanation?

00:06:14.743 --> 00:06:20.886
Be quiet. Whatever the reason, we won't tolerate
such violence in a school for gentlemen!

00:06:48.192 --> 00:06:50.069
Don't knock!

00:06:50.434 --> 00:06:51.894
I'm sorry!

00:06:56.034 --> 00:06:59.325
Strange... I'm sure I heard a knock...

00:07:02.284 --> 00:07:04.551
Annie, what's that basket for?

00:07:05.836 --> 00:07:09.615
Uh... there are sweets, books and food inside...

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:13.490
Annie, don't say that you want to go
to a picnic with me?

00:07:13.948 --> 00:07:14.884
But...

00:07:15.486 --> 00:07:21.208
But there is only about 100 meters from here to the
contemplation room, and you even brought sweets?

00:07:21.243 --> 00:07:22.995
But... this is...

00:07:23.415 --> 00:07:25.504
Let's get rid of that basket.

00:07:25.687 --> 00:07:26.803
No!

00:07:27.257 --> 00:07:30.319
If someone sees you carrying this,
you'll get in trouble!

00:07:30.354 --> 00:07:32.591
I wanted to take this to Archie...

00:07:32.869 --> 00:07:34.032
Give it to him?

00:07:36.118 --> 00:07:41.947
Gosh, I'm so dense...
Alright. Let's take the basket to him.

00:07:53.445 --> 00:07:54.918
It's your turn now, Annie!

00:07:57.647 --> 00:07:59.236
I'm afraid, Candy!

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:03.023
Listen, close your eyes and think
of Archie's face.

00:08:03.169 --> 00:08:04.904
Now, you'd better close your eyes.

00:08:07.574 --> 00:08:08.995
Hold on to this rope!

00:08:12.591 --> 00:08:15.279
Don't open your eyes!
Do your best.

00:08:30.111 --> 00:08:31.271
Strange...

00:08:39.181 --> 00:08:41.038
Kurin, are we alone?

00:08:42.388 --> 00:08:44.561
Annie, let me carry the basket for you.

00:08:44.739 --> 00:08:49.539
I'm fine! It's not so heavy when I think
of Archie in the contemplation room!

00:08:49.876 --> 00:08:51.459
If you really want that.

00:08:51.862 --> 00:08:53.710
-Let's hurry.
-Wait!

00:08:53.902 --> 00:08:56.892
Kurin, take a look around the northern wing.

00:08:59.118 --> 00:09:01.791
-Annie, let's rest a bit.
-But...

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:07.436
If they find us here, nobody will know
our real plan. Therefore, relax.

00:09:12.726 --> 00:09:13.843
Stars are beautiful.

00:09:16.906 --> 00:09:18.609
A midnight picnic...

00:09:19.004 --> 00:09:20.355
I remember, Candy!

00:09:20.637 --> 00:09:23.778
Come to think of it, remember the time
when the two of us went to a picnic?

00:09:30.238 --> 00:09:36.238
We stole sister Pony's wine... took the
food... it was so much fun!

00:09:37.537 --> 00:09:39.177
That's right, I remember.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:44.649
Here you go!

00:09:44.684 --> 00:09:48.653
-Can we eat this? It's for Archie...
-There is enough for everybody!

00:09:48.821 --> 00:09:49.570
What's this?

00:09:49.703 --> 00:09:52.680
It's a blanket. I thought Archie
might be cold at night...

00:09:53.397 --> 00:09:54.569
What's this pattern?

00:09:54.907 --> 00:09:59.821
It's called tartan check. They've been
making it in Scotland since old times.

00:10:00.305 --> 00:10:01.569
Tartan check?

00:10:04.368 --> 00:10:07.288
Come to think of it... The Prince on the hill...

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:12.798
Anthony, Stear and Archie...
they all wore kilts with this pattern.

00:10:21.298 --> 00:10:24.616
Say, are you sure that this Summer school
is really in Scotland?

00:10:25.423 --> 00:10:28.876
Yes, Scotland is a country of tartan check
and bagpipes.

00:10:29.599 --> 00:10:31.821
Annie, I'll go to Summer school.

00:10:32.185 --> 00:10:33.335
Really, Candy?

00:10:34.463 --> 00:10:36.540
I want to see Scotland with my own eyes.

00:10:36.725 --> 00:10:41.857
The place where Prince on the hill
and Anthony lived... Scotland.

00:11:02.562 --> 00:11:03.356
Kurin!

00:11:04.265 --> 00:11:06.552
Archie is in the contemplation room?

00:11:07.886 --> 00:11:09.408
Candice, open up!

00:11:09.718 --> 00:11:10.546
Candice!

00:11:11.198 --> 00:11:13.505
Open up, Candice! Are you in there?

00:11:14.235 --> 00:11:16.324
If you don't open, I'll enter myself.

00:11:22.827 --> 00:11:23.868
Candice?

00:11:24.573 --> 00:11:26.744
I suspected something was up.

00:11:28.595 --> 00:11:31.882
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
Sorry for the garish colors and audio errors in this EP,
it's the only copy I could lay my paws on.

00:11:52.666 --> 00:11:53.834
He's up there?

00:12:03.345 --> 00:12:06.954
-Now...
-Candy, I'm afraid!

00:12:07.361 --> 00:12:09.815
It's okay! You won't fall if you
come down slowly.

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:10.829
But I...

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:13.782
Just a little bit more!
Do your best, Annie!

00:12:14.509 --> 00:12:15.369
Now, come down.

00:12:18.323 --> 00:12:19.652
Thanks, Candy.

00:12:20.494 --> 00:12:21.526
Now, let's go.

00:12:30.649 --> 00:12:31.626
Candy!

00:12:36.505 --> 00:12:38.671
Annie, we're almost there.
Hurry up!

00:12:59.384 --> 00:13:00.510
Archie, are you there?

00:13:02.857 --> 00:13:04.183
Candy!

00:13:05.218 --> 00:13:06.185
Archie!

00:13:07.657 --> 00:13:08.921
Annie is with you?

00:13:09.636 --> 00:13:11.150
What are you doing here,
in the dead of the night?

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:16.550
Don't be so rude, two girls risked
their lives for you! Right, Annie?

00:13:16.722 --> 00:13:20.139
Archie... I was so worried...

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:23.107
Silly, I'm doing just fine in here!

00:13:23.151 --> 00:13:26.763
-We thought you'd feel down, right?
-I'm so glad...

00:13:26.798 --> 00:13:32.529
Candy, they locked me up in here,
but I still don't think I did anything wrong.

00:13:34.518 --> 00:13:36.587
I'm gonna settle the score with that Terry
next time I see him!

00:13:36.954 --> 00:13:38.128
Settle the score?

00:13:38.267 --> 00:13:39.940
I'm gonna challenge him to a duel!

00:13:40.158 --> 00:13:41.021
Duel?

00:13:41.327 --> 00:13:43.086
Stop those horrible things!

00:13:46.496 --> 00:13:47.641
What's the matter, Kurin?

00:13:51.912 --> 00:13:53.530
Oh no, somebody is coming this way.

00:13:54.559 --> 00:13:57.213
Annie, hurry and give the box to Archie.

00:13:57.335 --> 00:14:00.131
Archie, catch this!
We brought this for you.

00:14:01.502 --> 00:14:02.453
Thanks!

00:14:02.645 --> 00:14:04.515
-Archie...!
-Annie!

00:14:06.419 --> 00:14:09.270
Poor Archie.
I'll come to you again!

00:14:10.491 --> 00:14:12.279
Annie, if we don't hurry...

00:14:13.793 --> 00:14:14.958
Farewell, Archie!

00:14:14.959 --> 00:14:15.904
Annie.

00:14:21.172 --> 00:14:24.586
Listen up, Kurin! Show Annie
the other way out of here.

00:14:24.848 --> 00:14:26.123
Candy, what about you?

00:14:26.259 --> 00:14:28.092
I'll do something to buy you time.

00:14:28.232 --> 00:14:29.331
Now, go!

00:14:29.861 --> 00:14:30.608
Candy.

00:14:30.846 --> 00:14:33.229
Kurin, take care of Annie!

00:14:46.885 --> 00:14:48.176
Candice!

00:14:48.582 --> 00:14:49.443
Good evening.

00:14:49.993 --> 00:14:53.097
Candice White Adley, where were
you going this late at night?

00:14:53.836 --> 00:14:56.161
Uh, when I can't fall asleep,
I go for a night stroll...

00:14:56.335 --> 00:14:58.265
Are you making fun of Director?

00:14:58.407 --> 00:15:00.116
You went to the contemplation rooms, right?

00:15:00.117 --> 00:15:01.992
Yes, something like that...

00:15:02.498 --> 00:15:05.405
Sister Chrisse, escort Candice
back to her room.

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:07.638
-I'm going to check the contemplation rooms.
-Yes.

00:15:07.997 --> 00:15:09.566
Uh, just a second...

00:15:09.732 --> 00:15:12.625
Tommorrow we'll decide upon Candice's punishment.

00:15:15.722 --> 00:15:18.253
Annie... did you manage to escape?

00:15:25.824 --> 00:15:27.755
It's impossible.
Climbing this by myself...

00:15:33.913 --> 00:15:34.754
Patty!

00:15:36.892 --> 00:15:37.693
Hurry!

00:15:39.283 --> 00:15:40.558
Thank you, Patty!

00:15:40.734 --> 00:15:41.837
Is Candy with you?

00:15:48.402 --> 00:15:49.891
Candice White Adley!

00:15:50.059 --> 00:15:51.798
Your right for summer vacation is revoked.

00:15:51.799 --> 00:15:54.217
As a disciplinary action, you will
remain alone in the ward.

00:15:54.478 --> 00:15:55.458
But...!

00:15:55.882 --> 00:15:57.759
You're supposed to be a lady!
What business did you have sneaking into the...

00:15:57.760 --> 00:16:00.405
...contemplation room of the boys' ward,
and delivering a package?

00:16:00.565 --> 00:16:02.374
But... Archie is my relative.

00:16:03.053 --> 00:16:04.364
That's not an excuse!

00:16:11.871 --> 00:16:13.700
They canceled your summer vacation.

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:16.959
I'll go over to the Director!

00:16:17.542 --> 00:16:19.721
She doesn't have an ear for reason.

00:16:19.882 --> 00:16:23.002
No, not that! I'll ask her to cancel
my summer vacation, as well.

00:16:23.435 --> 00:16:24.290
Annie!

00:16:24.876 --> 00:16:28.168
You always kept pulling me out of troubles.

00:16:28.336 --> 00:16:32.294
But from now on, I want to start taking
responsibility for my own actions.

00:16:41.098 --> 00:16:43.742
Annie, Eliza and the others are eavesdropping.

00:16:44.094 --> 00:16:47.809
There's still about a week before summer vacation!
It'll work out somehow!

00:16:54.821 --> 00:16:58.603
It's easy to say that, but I don't think I'll
persuade that stubborn director to change her mind...

00:16:58.753 --> 00:17:00.125
Whatever I say, it'll do no good.

00:17:04.771 --> 00:17:06.809
What should I do now?

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:15.555
Terry!

00:17:16.718 --> 00:17:19.182
So rude, just appearing like that above my head!

00:17:19.353 --> 00:17:22.310
You too, I don't want anyone to bother me
when I want to be alone.

00:17:25.242 --> 00:17:27.282
This time, you came to regret your stubbornness.

00:17:27.636 --> 00:17:28.713
You already know?

00:17:28.888 --> 00:17:30.984
...that you won't be going on a summer vacation.

00:17:31.737 --> 00:17:33.269
Just when I started to think
you're kind...

00:17:33.651 --> 00:17:37.251
If you kindly ask me on your knees, something
good might come out of it.

00:17:37.535 --> 00:17:42.300
Who are you to say that? After all, it's your fault
that Archie wound up in the contemplation room!

00:17:42.804 --> 00:17:45.033
That's why I said I'd do something about it.

00:17:45.367 --> 00:17:48.064
I'd rather die than beg you on my knees!

00:17:49.009 --> 00:17:50.882
That's Freckled Tarzan.

00:17:59.665 --> 00:18:01.172
It's the dining hall lady.

00:18:01.639 --> 00:18:02.610
What's the matter?

00:18:04.661 --> 00:18:06.989
Miss, it's nothing.

00:18:11.268 --> 00:18:12.910
It's a letter from my son.

00:18:13.087 --> 00:18:16.468
He turned eight this year.
He lives in Scotland.

00:18:16.615 --> 00:18:19.454
Why did you tear his letter then?

00:18:19.605 --> 00:18:25.168
He wrote me a letter since he thought
I'd be coming home during the summer vacation.

00:18:27.333 --> 00:18:28.932
But my holidays have been canceled.

00:18:29.111 --> 00:18:31.507
It's my only holiday throughout the year.

00:18:32.067 --> 00:18:33.528
He'll be impatiently waiting for me...

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:35.635
My sweet son, with chestnut-colored hair
and wide eyes...

00:18:36.103 --> 00:18:39.817
He and his grandfather will be waiting
for my return.

00:18:49.057 --> 00:18:52.574
Why were your holidays canceled?

00:18:52.958 --> 00:18:58.880
One student will remain in school,
so I have to take care after him.

00:19:00.313 --> 00:19:02.555
That's me! Because of me...

00:19:02.744 --> 00:19:03.503
Lady!

00:19:03.883 --> 00:19:07.024
It's alright. It's our job, after all.

00:19:09.209 --> 00:19:14.485
I've even troubled the old lady with my actions.

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:30.039
Stear!

00:19:31.090 --> 00:19:31.799
Candy.

00:19:32.178 --> 00:19:33.389
Have you seen Terry?

00:19:33.433 --> 00:19:36.955
What? There's no way that he'd show up
for the morning prayer.

00:19:37.094 --> 00:19:41.722
Please, when you see him, tell him
that I'll beg him on my knees.

00:19:41.879 --> 00:19:43.735
You're going to beg him?

00:19:43.885 --> 00:19:45.694
What are you doing, Candice?

00:19:45.724 --> 00:19:46.871
Please do that, Stear!

00:19:49.022 --> 00:19:50.570
What was that?

00:19:51.423 --> 00:19:53.791
Brother, maybe your hearing is going?

00:19:54.181 --> 00:19:55.916
But Candy really said that!

00:19:56.363 --> 00:19:59.345
You think that Candy would've begged
that guy on her knees?

00:19:59.405 --> 00:20:02.249
That can't be! You must be mistaken!

00:20:02.436 --> 00:20:05.974
That's right. It is a mistake.
I never said that.

00:20:06.543 --> 00:20:07.482
-Terry!
-Terry!

00:20:07.976 --> 00:20:11.572
That Freckled Tarzan was mistaken
if she thought that.

00:20:12.095 --> 00:20:15.669
But.. that's what she said!
And to relay the message to you!

00:20:16.205 --> 00:20:16.869
What?

00:20:17.053 --> 00:20:18.565
To relay the mesage to me?

00:20:21.918 --> 00:20:22.996
Enter!

00:20:26.422 --> 00:20:28.326
You called, Director?

00:20:30.089 --> 00:20:32.677
I voided the revocation of your summer vacation.

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:33.899
Really?

00:20:34.071 --> 00:20:35.523
But why so suddenly?

00:20:35.869 --> 00:20:37.640
I did it on my own discretion.

00:20:38.204 --> 00:20:40.960
Then, I don't have to stay in the ward?

00:20:41.149 --> 00:20:41.873
Yes.

00:20:42.042 --> 00:20:46.053
However, you are obliged to enroll
in the Summer school in Scotland.

00:20:46.176 --> 00:20:48.772
-Yes. I understand!
-You may go.

00:20:51.359 --> 00:20:54.950
Director... I'm very sorry for
causing this much trouble.

00:20:56.404 --> 00:20:59.173
It's just that I'm a bit too easygoing!

00:20:59.355 --> 00:21:02.507
I realized that I need to think of people
whom I hurt for my own benefit!

00:21:02.954 --> 00:21:04.250
Who are you talking about?

00:21:04.605 --> 00:21:06.255
I'll be careful from now on!

00:21:11.151 --> 00:21:11.960
Lady!

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:16.837
Miss. I'll be going back to Scotland, after all!

00:21:17.692 --> 00:21:22.643
I got a job in the mansion of Duke Grandchester
in Scotland.

00:21:23.391 --> 00:21:24.775
Duke Grandchester?

00:21:25.037 --> 00:21:26.479
That's Terry's father!

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:30.963
I'll see my son for the first time in over a year...
I need to let him know that...

00:21:32.564 --> 00:21:33.682
It was Terry!

00:21:33.951 --> 00:21:35.728
Terry came to help us!

00:21:45.424 --> 00:21:46.381
Candy.

00:21:46.895 --> 00:21:48.758
I'm jealous of you and Archie.

00:21:49.352 --> 00:21:54.763
You were ready to beg me on your knees for the sake
of the old dining lady, whose name you don't even know.

00:21:55.682 --> 00:21:59.369
When I badmouthed Archie's homeland,
he burst out in passionate honesty.

00:22:06.523 --> 00:22:07.500
Terry.

00:22:07.501 --> 00:22:08.478
Thank you.

00:22:09.141 --> 00:22:11.110
You really are kind.

00:22:11.507 --> 00:22:13.412
Aren't you feeling lonely by yourself?

00:22:14.066 --> 00:22:16.219
Terry, let's go together.

00:22:16.845 --> 00:22:19.750
To Scotland, a country of tartan check and bagpipes.

00:22:20.647 --> 00:22:24.947
Inside her heart,
Candy cried out her thoughts to Terry.

00:22:25.621 --> 00:22:28.920
However,
she couldn't turn those thoughts into words.

00:22:29.083 --> 00:22:31.031
To be continued...

00:22:37.057 --> 00:22:45.614
Ashita wa doko kara
umarete kuru no

00:22:45.791 --> 00:22:55.217
Watashi wa, ashita ga,
ashita ga suki.

00:22:55.742 --> 00:23:04.460
Suteki na koto ga
ari sore

00:23:04.632 --> 00:23:13.977
Watashi wa, ashita ga
ashita ga suki.

00:23:14.153 --> 00:23:22.773
Kirakira hikaru
Kaze no mukou de

00:23:22.965 --> 00:23:32.864
Ano hito ga watashi wo
Watashi wo yondeiru - -

00:23:34.258 --> 00:23:44.884
Candy, Candy, Candy, Candy.

00:23:45.897 --> 00:23:48.815
*Next episode*
Summer school at the shore of a lake.

00:23:49.660 --> 00:23:51.115
Finally, summer vacations!

00:23:51.273 --> 00:23:55.710
Our Summer school is on the shore
of a lake in Scotland.

00:23:56.151 --> 00:23:57.967
We came just in time to see
the village festivities!

00:23:58.167 --> 00:24:02.716
The procession of kilt-wearing musicians
with bagpipes was wonderful!

00:24:03.320 --> 00:24:09.364
In that moment, an unknown young shepherd
stepped up to me and said that he knew me!

00:24:09.713 --> 00:24:13.110
Next time on Candy Candy,
"Summer school at the shore of a lake."

00:24:13.116 --> 00:24:14.901
Look forward to it!
